                                "sense_id": "82946f17-cd26-3c1a-8732-f8aa367d7216",
                                "text": "Диссертация эта ловко и больно уколола тогдашних славянофилов и разом доставила ему между ними многочисленных и разъяренных врагов.",
                                "translation": "This thesis cleverly and painfully needled the Slavophils of the day, and instantly gained him numerous and infuriated enemies among them.",
                                "english": "This thesis cleverly and painfully needled the Slavophils of the day, and instantly gained him numerous and infuriated enemies among them."
                            }
                        ]
